8.	Meticulous and well-organised, with strong communication and writing skills;
9.	Excellent interpersonal skills and a strong team player; and
10.	Effective collaborator with a demonstrated ability to work across teams to deliver project outcomes.


This is a contract post that will expire in Dec 2027.

