jobResponsibilities:
As a Trust Senior Executive, you will: 

(a)	administer cases involving the estates and un-nominated CPF monies of deceased persons;
(b)	administer the realisation of assets and distribution of monies of deceased persons to the beneficiaries according to the applicable laws; 
