#LI-SW1

jobResponsibilities:
You will manage cases relating to:
•	Employee and workplace-related cases, such as WICA-related administration;
•	Payroll and statutory matters, including CPF matters, outstanding liabilities and payroll alerts;
•	Secondment cases, including required HRP system updates and secondment billings; 
•	Employee-related transactions, such as annual air miles redemption, bonus payments and allowance administration; and
•	Processing of Awards, such as Long Service Award and Special Appreciation Award

You will take ownership of assigned cases from receipt to closure. This includes reviewing the required information and documents, completing the necessary HR and system transactions, following up on outstanding matters, and making sure each case is properly closed.

How this role is different

This is not quite the usual part-time role. This role is designed around a defined portfolio of work that you can take ownership of and see through to completion. The role could suit someone who has relevant HR or administrative experience and is looking for greater flexibility in how they contribute, while being comfortable taking independent ownership of clearly defined work.

